le are transformed into coffins and left unaware, while reality itself warps: the high school twists into a towering labyrinth known as Tartarus, prowled by monstrous beings called Shadows that prey upon the minds of those who remain conscious. A group of students, able to withstand the Dark Hour, have formed the Specialized Extracurricular Execution Squad, or SEES, to investigate these phenomena. Wielding the power to summon manifestations of their inner selves called Personas, they battle the Shadows, and a newly arrived transfer student soon finds himself drawn into their dangerous nightly struggle.", "summary": "Shin Megami Tensei: Persona 3 FES is an add-on disc for Persona 3 containing updates to the original game (referred in the game as \"The Journey\"), as well as a new epilogue story, The Answer, in which the player controls Aigis. The subtitle \"Fes\" is derived from the word \"festival\".", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/persona-3-fes", "videos": [{"id": 28899, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "j12-ZUIJpLE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j12-ZUIJpLE", "title": "Atlus USA Trailer: Persona 3 FES", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/j12-ZUIJpLE/hqdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 552, "name": "Persona"}, {"id": 3451, "name": "Persona 3"}]}